{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 1, "text": "等一下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 2, "text": "小声一点…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 3, "text": "再往前就很危险了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 4, "text": "对了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 5, "text": "你是怎么来到这里的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 7, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 8, "text": "这枚戒指能帮我打开正确的门，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 9, "text": "具体原理我也不清楚…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 11, "text": "戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 13, "text": "这个地方怎么回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 14, "text": "为什么会这么黑？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 16, "text": "我一会儿再跟你解释，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 17, "text": "朝这间客厅的正门走吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 18, "text": "我们在游戏机那里见。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 22, "text": "快走吧，别耽搁太久了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 25, "text": "// After mini-game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 26, "text": "怎么样？你明白这个游戏的意义了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 28, "text": "我的皮肤下是血肉之躯，而你的皮肤下是骨骼模型？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 30, "text": "哎呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 31, "text": "你怎么说得这么吓人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 32, "text": "但恐怕就是这样的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 34, "text": "明白了，但是为什么把这样的信息告诉我呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 36, "text": "你以为我刚才说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 37, "text": "再往前走很危险，是在跟你开玩笑吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 38, "text": "再往前走，你就会遇到那些失败之作…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 39, "text": "那些被淘汰的存在，那些“没能成型”的存在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 40, "text": "比起正常的原型，她们具有很强的攻击性，你也不想死在她们手里吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 42, "text": "那我也没得选。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 43, "text": "哪里有打开的门，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 44, "text": "我就去哪里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 46, "text": "哇哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 47, "text": "那就不要背对着她们。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 48, "text": "不要让她们离开你的视线！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 49, "text": "当你盯着她们看时，她们会感到非常羞耻，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 50, "text": "羞耻到全身僵硬，无法行动。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 51, "text": "记住这点，会对你有所帮助！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Quest 1 (Why are there other Mitas down there?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 60, "text": "她们才刚刚拿到皮肤，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 61, "text": "现在还需要点时间，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 62, "text": "来培养出一些自我意识。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 63, "text": "然后，我要把它们一个一个"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 64, "text": "送回她们自己家里…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 66, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why is it so dark downstairs?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 67, "text": "米塔基本上都是在黑暗中 \"诞生 \"的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 68, "text": "因此，首先她们需要在黑暗中多待一会儿…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 69, "text": "你能想象吗，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 70, "text": "对她们来说一下子走到阳光下是多么痛苦啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Quest 3 (What are you doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 73, "text": "你还没明白吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 74, "text": "我在帮助这些可怜的米塔习惯新环境！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 75, "text": "我不帮她们，谁会来帮她们？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 76, "text": "难道你会吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 78, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do we need this conveyor?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 79, "text": "这个传送带是来干什么的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 80, "text": "每个人能有足够的空间吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 82, "text": "等等，你到底知不知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 83, "text": "我们的世界是如何运转的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 84, "text": "以及它其实是无限的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 86, "text": "无限？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 87, "text": "嗯……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 88, "text": "那么是怎么回事呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 89, "text": "如果最新的版本是 1.9"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 90, "text": "就代表一共只有19个世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 92, "text": "天哪，我觉得你真的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 93, "text": "你完全理解错了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 94, "text": "我可以在这块黑板上给你解释"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 95, "text": "我可以把这个世界的一切都告诉你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 96, "text": "你想听吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Quest 5 (What is your version?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 99, "text": "我觉得，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 100, "text": "我已经在最新版本中见过你了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 101, "text": "不过也可能是我以为我见过你了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 103, "text": "有可能！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 104, "text": "我的版本是 1.5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 105, "text": "你去过那个版本吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 107, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 108, "text": "在我第一次来到这里时"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 109, "text": "我当时也在场！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 111, "text": "哎呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 112, "text": "怎么会这样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 113, "text": "我想知道你进入的房子编号是多少。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 114, "text": "那里有一个 \"我\"喜欢没完没了地发牢骚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 115, "text": "还有一个 \"我\"总是喜欢玩耍。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 116, "text": "另外有一个\"我\"总是忘事，还喜欢欺负人。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 117, "text": "哦，这太多了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 118, "text": "你还记得什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 120, "text": "我记得那里一片漆黑。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 121, "text": "还有一些文字，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 122, "text": "好像是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 123, "text": "“一起玩吧”"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 125, "text": "哦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 126, "text": "真是遗憾。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 127, "text": "是那个，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 128, "text": "喜欢欺负人，还总是忘事的“我”。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [No]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 131, "text": "不需要，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 132, "text": "船到桥头自然直。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 134, "text": "嗯，好吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [Yes]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 137, "text": "好吧，请说。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 138, "text": "但愿不会像在学校那样，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 139, "text": "无聊到让我睡着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 141, "text": "你想走可以随时离开。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 142, "text": "但如果你有兴趣，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 143, "text": "不妨听一听。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 144, "text": "一位玩家将《MiSide》下载到了自己的手机上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 145, "text": "他心满意足地坐着玩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 146, "text": "就这样，他创造出了一间新家，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 147, "text": "和一个新的米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 148, "text": "这里绘制的是二维图像。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 149, "text": "这些版本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 150, "text": "它们都以线条表示。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 151, "text": "这些线条上分布着许多小屋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 152, "text": "你下载的游戏版本是 1.14。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 153, "text": "在这个版本中，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 154, "text": "新生命诞生了，米塔和她的小屋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 156, "text": "天哪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 158, "text": "你可以问些具体的问题，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 159, "text": "比如画在这里的东西。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 160, "text": "我会试着解释一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 162, "text": "// He asks about the only circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 163, "text": "为什么这里只有一个圆圈？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 164, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 165, "text": "因为这个版本只发布过一次。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 166, "text": "它也没有以任何其他方式发行，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 167, "text": "所以它是独一无二的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 168, "text": "此外，这些版本还有一个特点，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 169, "text": "它们之间无法相互通行。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 170, "text": "瞌睡米塔就住在 1.1 版本中。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 172, "text": "瞌睡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 173, "text": "这是因为米塔们都会经过这个版本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 174, "text": "所以她没办法好好睡觉吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 176, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 177, "text": "我可以直接从她面前走过，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 178, "text": "无论发出多大的声音她都不会醒的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 180, "text": "// He asks about the shaded circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 181, "text": "为什么这个球被涂成黑色了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 183, "text": "事实上，这幅画之所以出现在这里，是因为"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 184, "text": "可爱米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 185, "text": "这是她画的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 186, "text": "当时我和她正在争论"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 187, "text": "怎样才能更快到达 1.11 版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 189, "text": "那最后是谁赢了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 191, "text": "当然是我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 192, "text": "看，我们在这里"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 193, "text": "1.15 版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 194, "text": "809号房子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 195, "text": "我们需要达到 1.11 版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 196, "text": "到805号房子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 197, "text": "最开始，她的路线是这样的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 198, "text": "我们想找一条更短的路线。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 199, "text": "然后，可爱米塔建议走这条路线。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 200, "text": "但我只画出了最简单的路径。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 201, "text": "很明显吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 202, "text": "你看。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 203, "text": "从这里，可以直接进入你想要的版本"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 204, "text": "虽然看起来这栋房子会挡住去路。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 205, "text": "让你无法通过。…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 206, "text": "对了，你的戒指也是根据同样的原理工作的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 207, "text": "他要带你到哪里去呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 209, "text": "我要去核心区域。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 211, "text": "核心区域？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 212, "text": "真有意思…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 213, "text": "如果你想要抄近路的话。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 214, "text": "那么你也会经过1.11版本的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 215, "text": "然后一定会遇到瞌睡米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 216, "text": "我认为，引导你的米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 217, "text": "选择的也是这一条路。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 218, "text": "或者她并没有意识到，你去的是另一条路线。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 219, "text": "又或者她是个天才，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 220, "text": "想出了一条更短的路线！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 222, "text": "我想我明白了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 224, "text": "// He asks about the inscription"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 225, "text": "这又是怎么回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 227, "text": "这是给酷米塔的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 228, "text": "她几小时后就会到了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 229, "text": "她会把那些盒子收起来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 230, "text": "然后在这里放一张沙发！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 231, "text": "我的屁股都坐疼了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 233, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 234, "text": "有什么可以帮你的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 236, "text": "不用，这是酷米塔的事情。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 237, "text": "她她力气大着呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 239, "text": "// He asks about the drawings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 240, "text": "这只是一幅画？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 241, "text": "还是说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 242, "text": "它也代表着什么存在？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 243, "text": ""}
